This crate is licensed under the Business Source License 1.1, the same licence
as the rest of IronVise. The full text is in the LICENSE file at the root of
this repository, and its terms, including the Change Date, the Change License
and the Additional Use Grant for verification, apply here unchanged.

It is stated separately because this crate is excluded from the Cargo workspace
(it targets a different architecture and is built only by the host's build.rs
under a feature flag), so it does not inherit `license.workspace = true`. Both
crates previously declared Apache-2.0 while compiling into the BUSL-licensed
host binary; the maintainer resolved that contradiction in favour of BUSL-1.1.

The client SDKs under sdk/ remain separately Apache-2.0. That separation is
deliberate: a client library that talks to a BUSL server should not carry the
server's licence.
